# Git push on every code update

After completing any code change in this project:

1. Stage relevant files (`git add`).
2. Create a commit with a clear message (unless the user asked not to commit).
3. Push to `origin` on the current branch (`git push`).

Remote repository: `https://github.com/brightwaterfall/Figma_To_HTML_For_Hubspot_Email`

Do not skip the push step after updates. Do not commit secrets (tokens, `.env`). Prefer `main` as the default branch.
